{"gospel":{"reference":"Jean 17, 1-13","title":"La prière sacerdotale du Christ","interlinear":[{"verse_number":"17, 1","translations":{"segond":"Après avoir ainsi parlé, Jésus leva les yeux au ciel, et dit : Père, l'heure est venue ! Glorifie ton Fils, afin que ton Fils te glorifie,","darby":"Jésus dit ces choses, et leva ses yeux au ciel et dit : Père, l'heure est venue ; glorifie ton Fils, afin que ton Fils te glorifie,"},"interlinear":[{"greek":"Ταῦτα","gloss":"Ces_choses"},{"greek":"ἐλάλησεν","gloss":"parla"},{"greek":"Ἰησοῦς,","gloss":"Jésus"},{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"ἐπάρας","gloss":"ayant_levé"},{"greek":"τοὺς","gloss":"les"},{"greek":"ὀφθαλμοὺς","gloss":"yeux"},{"greek":"αὐτοῦ","gloss":"de_lui"},{"greek":"εἰς","gloss":"vers"},{"greek":"τὸν","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"οὐρανὸν","gloss":"ciel"},{"greek":"εἶπεν·","gloss":"il_dit"},{"greek":"Πάτερ,","gloss":"Père"},{"greek":"ἐλήλυθεν","gloss":"est_venue"},{"greek":"ἡ","gloss":"l'"},{"greek":"ὥρα·","gloss":"heure"},{"greek":"δόξασόν","gloss":"glorifie"},{"greek":"σου","gloss":"de_toi"},{"greek":"τὸν","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"υἱόν,","gloss":"Fils"},{"greek":"ἵνα","gloss":"afin_que"},{"greek":"ὁ","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"υἱὸς","gloss":"Fils"},{"greek":"δοξάσῃ","gloss":"glorifie"},{"greek":"σέ,","gloss":"toi"}]},{"verse_number":"17, 2","translations":{"segond":"selon que tu lui as donné pouvoir sur toute chair, afin qu'il accorde la vie éternelle à tous ceux que tu lui as donnés.","darby":"selon que tu lui as donné autorité sur toute chair, afin que, pour tout ce que tu lui as donné, il leur donne la vie éternelle."},"interlinear":[{"greek":"καθὼς","gloss":"selon_que"},{"greek":"ἔδωκας","gloss":"tu_as_donné"},{"greek":"αὐτῷ","gloss":"à_lui"},{"greek":"ἐξουσίαν","gloss":"pouvoir/autorité"},{"greek":"πάσης","gloss":"de_toute"},{"greek":"σαρκός,","gloss":"chair"},{"greek":"ἵνα","gloss":"afin_que"},{"greek":"πᾶν","gloss":"tout_ce_que"},{"greek":"ὃ","gloss":"que"},{"greek":"δέδοκας","gloss":"tu_as_donné"},{"greek":"αὐτῷ","gloss":"à_lui"},{"greek":"δώσῃ","gloss":"il_donne"},{"greek":"αὐτοῖς","gloss":"à_eux"},{"greek":"ζωὴν","gloss":"vie"},{"greek":"αἰώνιον.","gloss":"éternelle"}]},{"verse_number":"17, 3","translations":{"segond":"Or, la vie éternelle, c'est qu'ils te connaissent, toi, le seul vrai Dieu, et celui que tu as envoyé, Jésus-Christ.","darby":"Et c'est ici la vie éternelle, qu'ils te connaissent toi, le seul vrai Dieu, et celui que tu as envoyé, Jésus Christ."},"interlinear":[{"greek":"αὕτη","gloss":"Celle-ci"},{"greek":"δέ","gloss":"or"},{"greek":"ἐστιν","gloss":"est"},{"greek":"ἡ","gloss":"la"},{"greek":"αἰώνιος","gloss":"éternelle"},{"greek":"ζωή,","gloss":"vie"},{"greek":"ἵνα","gloss":"afin_que"},{"greek":"γινώσκωσι","gloss":"ils_connaissent"},{"greek":"σὲ","gloss":"toi"},{"greek":"τὸν","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"μόνον","gloss":"seul"},{"greek":"ἀληθινὸν","gloss":"vrai"},{"greek":"θεὸν","gloss":"Dieu"},{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"ὃν","gloss":"celui_que"},{"greek":"ἀπέστειλας","gloss":"tu_as_envoyé"},{"greek":"Ἰησοῦν","gloss":"Jésus"},{"greek":"Χριστόν.","gloss":"Christ"}]},{"verse_number":"17, 4","translations":{"segond":"Je t'ai glorifié sur la terre, j'ai achevé l'œuvre que tu m'as donnée à faire.","darby":"Moi, je t'ai glorifié sur la terre, j'ai achevé l'œuvre que tu m'as donnée à faire ;"},"interlinear":[{"greek":"ἐγώ","gloss":"Moi"},{"greek":"σε","gloss":"toi"},{"greek":"ἐδόξασα","gloss":"j'ai_glorifié"},{"greek":"ἐπὶ","gloss":"sur"},{"greek":"τῆς","gloss":"la"},{"greek":"γῆς,","gloss":"terre"},{"greek":"tὸ","gloss":"l'"},{"greek":"ἔργον","gloss":"œuvre"},{"greek":"τελειώσας","gloss":"ayant_achevé/accompli"},{"greek":"ὃ","gloss":"que"},{"greek":"δέδωκάς","gloss":"tu_m'as_donné"},{"greek":"μοι","gloss":"à_moi"},{"greek":"ἵνα","gloss":"afin_que"},{"greek":"ποιήσω·","gloss":"je_fasse"}]},{"verse_number":"17, 5","translations":{"segond":"Et maintenant toi, Père, glorifie-moi auprès de toi-même de la gloire que j'avais auprès de toi avant que le monde